### Storefront (public)
GET http://localhost:1337/api/storefront/catalog/brands
GET http://localhost:1337/api/storefront/catalog/brands/acme-parts/models
GET http://localhost:1337/api/storefront/catalog/brands/acme-parts/models/widget-x100/products
GET http://localhost:1337/api/storefront/catalog/brands/acme-parts/models/widget-x100/products/ACME-FILTER-001
GET http://localhost:1337/api/storefront/catalog/products/ACME-FILTER-001
GET http://localhost:1337/api/storefront/cms/home-hero

### Auth
POST http://localhost:1337/api/storefront/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"buyer@example.com","password":"password123"}

###
POST http://localhost:1337/api/storefront/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"buyer@example.com","password":"password123"}

###
GET http://localhost:1337/api/storefront/auth/session
Authorization: Bearer <customer_jwt>

### Account (customer JWT)
GET http://localhost:1337/api/storefront/account/addresses
Authorization: Bearer <customer_jwt>

### Checkout (guest example — response adds paymentContinuationSecret for Razorpay GraphQL mutations)
POST http://localhost:1337/api/storefront/checkout/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lines": [{"sku":"ACME-FILTER-001","quantity":1}],
  "contactEmail":"guest@example.com",
  "contactPhone":"9876543210",
  "guestShipping": {
    "customerName":"Guest User",
    "line1":"12 MG Road",
    "line2":"",
    "city":"Bengaluru",
    "state":"KA",
    "postalCode":"560001",
    "countryCode":"IN",
    "phone":"9876543210"
  }
}

### Payments (internal key)
POST http://localhost:1337/api/payments/razorpay/order
Content-Type: application/json
x-internal-api-key: <STRAPI_INTERNAL_API_KEY>

{"orderId":1}

###
GET http://localhost:1337/api/payments/orders/1
x-internal-api-key: <STRAPI_INTERNAL_API_KEY>

### Admin (internal key + Strapi admin Bearer)
GET http://localhost:1337/api/admin/orders/ops-summary
x-internal-api-key: <STRAPI_INTERNAL_API_KEY>
Authorization: Bearer <strapi_admin_access_token>

###
POST http://localhost:1337/api/admin/inventory/adjust
Content-Type: application/json
x-internal-api-key: <STRAPI_INTERNAL_API_KEY>
Authorization: Bearer <strapi_admin_access_token>

{"sku":"ACME-FILTER-001","delta":5}

### Webhooks (signatures / secrets)
POST http://localhost:1337/api/webhooks/shipping-events
Content-Type: application/json
x-shipper-secret: <SHIPROCKET_WEBHOOK_SECRET>

{"shipmentId":1,"nextStatus":"BOOKED"}
